+# Version numbering scheme
+
+No version numbering scheme is recorded as a decision for this project. The only thing on record about it is a bare, unconfirmed statement from the project's session history, "semver", meaning semantic versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH). It was not confirmed by a commit or an exit code and was never recorded as a decision, so it should be treated as the most recent indication and not as a settled policy. Until the maintainers record a decision, nothing further is established about how versions are numbered.
